workspaces.help = Kōjparok āinwōt ej kōṃṃan juon kape eo ewor etan jen laajrak eo kiiō. Kālet juon laajrak emōj kōjparok ñan jerbal kake, kōkkāāl, ukot etan ak jolok. Ukok ko ilo laajrak rej walok ilo ien eo wōt.
workspaces.show_panels = Kwaļok panel ko ilo pee
workspaces.automatic = Ej jerbal make
workspaces.reset_help = Bar kōṃṃane ej kōrọol laajrak in panel ko ñan wāween eo jinoin wōt. Jikin jerbal ko emōj kōjparok, pepa ko, im kālet ko jet rej pād wōt.
workspaces.save_error = Ejjab maron kōjparok kālet ko an jikin jerbal. Ukok eo ejjab walok.
workspaces.invalid_name = Deloñ juon etan ewor 1–80 leta im ejjelok kakōlkōl in kōmanda.
workspaces.duplicate = Juon jikin jerbal ewor etan in emōj wōr.
workspaces.limit = Kwo maron kōjparok jikin jerbal ko ñan 64.
workspaces.keyboard = Kīpōd: Alt+↑/↓ ej kālet juon laajrak. Ctrl/Cmd+N ej ukot etan; +S ej kōjparok juon kape; +Enter ej kōṃṃane; +U ej kōkkāāl; +R ej ukot etan; +D ej jolok; +0 ej bar kōṃṃane.
